        "modern_text": "<table><tr><td>类别</td><td>窝“穴”</td><td>钳“穴”</td><td>乳“穴”</td><td>突“穴”</td></tr><tr><td>太阳金</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>太阴金</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></table>",
        "confidence": "high",
